sequenceDiagram
    participant Metrics as MetricsAgent
    participant Cross as CrossCorrelator
    participant RCA as RootCauseAgent
    participant Report as ReportGenerator

    Metrics->>Metrics: 扫描指标
    Metrics->>Cross: 原始指标时序
    Metrics->>RCA: 异常事件列表

    Note over Cross: 14 模式匹配
    Cross->>Cross: analyze() → cross_hits

    Note over RCA: 因果图反向推理
    RCA->>RCA: diagnose() → root_causes

    Note over RCA: 加权排序
    RCA->>RCA: cross_hits 对 root_causes 加权 (+0.3)

    RCA->>Report: root_causes (排序) + cross_hits
    Report->>Report: 降噪聚合
    Report->>Report: 输出最终根因
